slider44:35<-100,100,1>-Tom 2 Pan
slider45:65<0,100,0.1>-Tom 2 Level
slider46:0<-24,24,0.1>-Metal Tune (st)
slider47:10<0,100,0.1>-Metal Snap
slider48:25<0,100,0.1>-Metal Fold
